                <pb facs="0794" n="696" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg696"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Everett to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-08"><hi rendition="#italic">October 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Everett acknowledges Mr. Hay’s telegram of the 6th instant, and states that
                    it did not specify gold or currency; that the Honduran Government offers
                    immediate payment of $5,000 currency, and that he defers reply to the offer
                    pending instructions from the Department.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
